iquid":"<section class=\"jf-crafted jf-reveal\">\n  <div class=\"jf-crafted__wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"jf-crafted__title\">Crafted to Order<\/h2>\n\n    <div class=\"jf-crafted__divider\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/div>\n\n    <p class=\"jf-crafted__intro\">\n      Each candle is hand-poured to order in our New Hampshire studio—an intentional process that ensures freshness, performance, and refined quality in every burn.\n    <\/p>\n\n    <!-- SEO reinforcement -->\n    <p class=\"jf-crafted__seo\">\n      Luxury soy candles hand-poured in New Hampshire, crafted in small batches using clean-burning wax and premium fragrance oils.\n    <\/p>\n\n    <p class=\"jf-crafted__statement\">\n      Made fresh for your order. Never mass-produced.\n    <\/p>\n\n    <p class=\"jf-crafted__leadtime\">\n      Please allow <strong>3–5 business days<\/strong> for crafting.\n    <\/p>\n\n    <h4 class=\"jf-crafted__tagline\">\n      Because true quality is never rushed.\n    <\/h4>\n  <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<style>\n.shopify-section:has(.jf-crafted){\n  padding:0 !important;\n  margin:0 !important;\n  max-width:100% !important;\n}\n\n.jf-crafted{\n  background:#EAE4DC;\n  width:100vw;\n  margin-left:calc(50% - 50vw);\n  padding-top:clamp(72px,6vw,96px);\n  padding-bottom:clamp(72px,6vw,96px);\n}\n\n\/* wrap *\/\n.jf-crafted__wrap{\n  max-width:900px;\n  margin:0 auto;\n  text-align:center;\n  padding:0 24px;\n}\n\n\/* title *\/\n.jf-crafted__title{\n  margin:0;\n  font-weight:500;\n  letter-spacing:.02em;\n  line-height:1.15;\n  font-size:clamp(1.875rem,2.6vw,2.5rem);\n  color:#1F1F1F;\n}\n\n\/* divider *\/\n.jf-crafted__divider{\n  width:min(120px,32vw);\n  height:1px;\n  margin:18px auto 0;\n  background:linear-gradient(\n    90deg,\n    rgba(196,169,137,0) 0%,\n    rgba(196,169,137,1) 50%,\n    rgba(196,169,137,0) 100%\n  );\n}\n\n\/* intro *\/\n.jf-crafted__intro{\n  margin:22px auto 0;\n  font-size:clamp(16px,1.35vw,19px);\n  line-height:1.75;\n  color:#3E3A36;\n  max-width:720px;\n}\n\n\/* hidden SEO *\/\n.jf-crafted__seo{\n  position:absolute;\n  left:-9999px;\n}\n\n\/* statement (hero line) *\/\n.jf-crafted__statement{\n  margin:34px auto 0;\n  font-size:clamp(20px,2vw,28px);\n  line-height:1.35;\n  font-weight:500;\n  color:#1F1F1F;\n}\n\n\/* lead time *\/\n.jf-crafted__leadtime{\n  margin:14px auto 0;\n  font-size:clamp(15px,1.3vw,18px);\n  line-height:1.7;\n  color:#3E3A36;\n}\n\n\/* tagline *\/\n.jf-crafted__tagline{\n  margin:28px auto 0;\n  font-size:clamp(14px,1.1vw,16px);\n  letter-spacing:.08em;\n  text-transform:uppercase;\n  color:#60605F;\n}\n\n\/* reveal animation *\/\n.jf-reveal{\n  opacity:0;\n  transform:translateY(16px);\n  transition:opacity .8s ease, transform .9s ease;\n}\n.jf-reveal.is-visible{\n  opacity:1;\n  transform:translateY(0);\n}\n\n\/* mobile *\/\n@media (max-width:768px){\n  .jf-crafted{\n    padding-top:52px;\n    padding-bottom:52px;\n  }\n}\n<\/style>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  const el = document.querySelector('.jf-reveal');\n  if(!el) return;\n\n  if('IntersectionObserver' in window){\n    const io = new IntersectionObserver(entries=>{\n      entries.forEach(entry=>{\n        if(entry.isIntersecting){\n          el.classList.add('is-visible');\n          io.disconnect();\n        }\n      });\n    },{threshold:0.15});\n    io.observe(el);\n  } else {\n    el.classList.add('is-visible');\n  }\n})();\n<\/script>","full_width":true,"show_section_divider":false,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"full_width_mobile":true,"show_section_divider_mobile":false,"padding_top_mobile":0,"padding_bottom_mobile":0}},"image_with_text_9a4bDw":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_8yzmcn":{"type":"heading","settings":{"subheading":"LAVENDER SOY CANDLE","heading":"Calming. [Floral.] Restorative.","highlight_type":"font_highlight","heading_base_size":70,"heading_tag":"h2","text":"<p>Unwind with the soothing aroma of fresh lavender blossoms, known for their calming and restorative qualities. Hand-poured with 100% 